Perform a Taylor expansion of $V(r)$ around $r = r_{0} = \left( \frac{B}{A} \right)^{\frac{1}{6}}$, or let $r^{\prime} = r - r_{0}$ and perform a Taylor expansion around $r^{\prime} = 0$, retaining only the second-order small quantities,

