& = \frac{1}{2}\left(x - \frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d} x}\right)\left(6x^{2} - 3\right) e^{-x^{2}/2} \\
& = 3\left(2x^{3} - 3x\right) e^{-x^{2}/2} = 3\psi_{a}
\end{aligned}
$$

Thus, the occupation number corresponding to \(\psi_{a}\) is 3.

